OL,3,A'Everything is under mud': Nepal death
OL,4,Atoll rises to 389 amid fears of new
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescuers are looking for survivors
OL,8,Fafter Wednesday's flash flood on the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border destroyed homes,
OL,10,Fswamped roads and swept away bridges
OL,12,FMore than 900 people are missing and at
OL,13,Fleast 389 have died in Nepal
OL,15,FThe US Geological Survey says "glacial
OL,16,Fcollapse and debris flow" triggered the
OL,17,Fdeluge - and there are risks of more
OL,18,Ffloods
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
