OL,3,A'Everything is under mud': Nepal death
OL,4,Atoll rises to 389 amid fears of new
OL,5,Aflood
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn Tibet, at least 558 people are
OL,8,Fmissing, with three confirmed dead, but
OL,9,Fit's not clear if these figures overlap
OL,10,Fwith Nepal's
OL,12,FOn both sides of the border, hundreds
OL,13,Fof foreigners are missing - Nepal says
OL,14,Fthat includes 178 tourists from India,
OL,15,F65 Americans, and 33 from the UK.
OL,16,FDozens of army and police personnel are
OL,17,Falso missing
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a man in Sussex tells us he
OL,20,Fthinks his wife, mum, uncle and brother
OL,21,Fmay have died in Nepal
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
